effects.Nakasar_Fractal_Crystal_Charged = Charged crystal
effects.Nakasar_Fractal_Jade_Targeted = Targeted by the Maw: hold a crystal!
intro = Dessa: "How bizarre. The readings state that this was water once. Good news, this fractal appears stable." Cross the jade fragments: a fall brings you back to the previous one.
landing.back = Caught above the solid ocean: back to the last fragment.
arena = Dessa: "I retract my statement. Unstable event! Right in front of you!" The Jade Maw is invulnerable: slay the two tentacles guarding it.
checkpoint = Respawn point moved.
agony = The Maw crushes you with agony!
phase.colossi = The Maw awakens: four tentacles pierce the jade and colossi emerge ({count} in all). Colossi and tentacles drop a crystal: pick it up (crouch) and hold one when the Maw targets you!
phase.final = The last colossus has fallen: new tentacles emerge and regrow 30 s after they fall.
skull = The Maw targets you: hold a crystal before the countdown ends, or the beam kills you!
crystal.crouch = Crouch to pick up the crystal.
crystal.already = You already carry a crystal.
skull.other = The Maw targets {name}.
absorbed = The crystal absorbs the beam: you are charged. Throw it at the Maw (right-click)!
beam.hit = The Maw's beam strikes you down.
crystal.noTarget = Aim at the Jade Maw to throw the crystal.
crystal.uncharged = The crystal isn't charged: let the beam hit it first.
crystal.hit = The charged crystal strikes the Maw!
crystal.drop = A reflecting crystal falls to the ground.
last.beam = The Maw targets everyone: HOLD A CRYSTAL!
reflect = The colossus is immune to ranged attacks: strike it in melee.
reset = The Jade Maw closes: everything starts over.
victory = Dessa: "The fractal's stable, thank the Alchemy. Now, hurry up and exit before something else appears."
title.victory = Solid Ocean complete
